# https://jasonstitt.com/gitignore-whitelisting-patterns
# Ignore everything
*
# But descend into directories
!*/
# You can be specific with these rules
!code/*.R
!R/*.R
# Recursively allow files under subtree
!.gitignore
DESCRIPTION
!*.Rmd
!*.Rproj
# https://stackoverflow.com/questions/44568184/gitignore-everything-except-a-subfolder-with-every-content
.Rproj.user